    "en": "Hyrule Warriors: Age of Calamity guide—combo extension, Guardian weakness exploiting, and champion ability timing.",
    "ja": "ゼルダ無双厄災の黙示録攻略。コンボ延長・ガーディアン弱点攻略・勇者能力タイミングを解説。"
